"\"><option>--gametype</option> <replaceable> igra</replaceable></group>"

#. Tag: title
#: man-kpat.6.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "OPIS"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kpat.6.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kpatience; is a compendium of several well known patience card games, "
"ranging from the well known Klondike and Freecell, to lesser known games "
"such as Grandfather's Clock and Mod3. In all there are 12 variations for you "
"to while away time."
msgstr ""
"&kpatience; je sažet od nekoliko dobro poznatih kartaških igara "
"strpljivosti, počevši od poznate Klondike i FreeCell, do manje poznatih "
"igara kao što su Grandfather's Clock i Mod3. U svim postoji 12 varijacije za "
"vas  tokom odsutnog vremena."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kpat.6.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "OPCIJE"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kpat.6.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This program follows the usual GNU command line syntax, with long options "
"starting with two dashes (`--'). A summary of the options supported by "
"<command>kpat</command> is included below."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj program prati uobičajene GNU komandne linije sintakse, s dugim opcijama "
"počevši sa dvije crtice (`-- '). Sažetak opcija je podržan <command> kpat </"
"command> je uključena u nastavku."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kpat.6.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generic Options"
msgstr "Opšte Opcije"

